#OBSD
>> dirname := [''].
{ dirname tafoegje: ['X/']. } * (1024 / 2 - 4).
>> command := ['mkdir -p /tmp/'] + dirname.
Programma systeem: command.
Programma chdir: ['/tmp/'] + dirname.
>> filename := [''].
{ filename tafoegje: ['YYYYYYYY']. } * 20.
Bestand nĳ: filename, skriuwe: ['sometext'].
{ Bestand rige: ['/tmp/'] + dirname. } * 1000.
Utfier skriuwe: ['no crash'], nije-rigel.

